   "sourceHash": "1e8d8277e67211c043f83d8ccf74ff3bbb87e40e576dc3745ccb12b670ff43ae",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]心血管健康与血压治疗[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f0be064eb1058fde1250",
   "sourceHash": "f0be064eb1058fde12507398e09e50d5cae9b6ac0ac11e2715c8bf999e3a8cf6",
   "text": "高血压会带来严重的健康风险，如心脏病发作、中风等。营养不良、压力和过度劳累等生活方式因素都会导致这一病症。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a6e3dba4e27d5e212793",
   "sourceHash": "a6e3dba4e27d5e2127930167032d5dce32f53091fe1f56c5f4da68789887c2a6",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 提供为期 14/21/28 天的阿育吠陀血压治疗。专家会找出根本原因，并提供量身定制的疗法。阿育吠陀疗程、草药产品及按摩（如 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Thakaradhara（塔克拉达拉）和 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽））可排出毒素、恢复健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32d734f7090197a1a63c",
   "sourceHash": "32d734f7090197a1a63cbdf6a1aacba8c4d36c01bd6153046dd0f053493cf030",
   "text": "消化问题也是影响因素之一，医院会确保患者遵循处方阿育吠陀饮食，以促进净化并增强消化功能。在宁静的环境中进行冥想和瑜伽等放松身心的练习，有助于减轻压力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'the resort' rendered as 医院 (hospital) per KTAHV language lock"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0e769600933790607b2a",
