   "sourceHash": "0d1044211297a42d839da56047c47a903e0a3ba95fe413667675d705a5ac56ab",
   "text": "高血压自然疗法的步骤通常包括以下内容：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_33aefdba11365179f131",
   "sourceHash": "33aefdba11365179f13129a9fcff335ec8592bea5d49fc8e3e42e3281944b499",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀着眼于整个身体，兼顾身体、心理和情绪健康，以应对高血压的根本原因。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e5ffc162d165e4d5d625",
   "sourceHash": "e5ffc162d165e4d5d625068e8abce2bbb0d04f57abc31d2167598f443ef58bdc",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]治疗根据个人体质、健康状况和需求量身定制，确保以独特的方式管理高血压。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1d9f2c403fd0660a0105",
   "sourceHash": "1d9f2c403fd0660a0105cd3b5a43ff799ad078e745af71c5ad742274b3c2dedd",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀疗法和草药提供天然的替代选择，减少对合成药物的依赖及其潜在副作用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_334af0c858882261525c",
   "sourceHash": "334af0c858882261525cd826576f85992a432cc93a5b43fb5ba00e688de1679a",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀注重长效方案，通过调理潜在失衡、促进整体健康（包括调整生活方式）来管理高血压。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3ba095701ed0d20b6bfe",
   "sourceHash": "3ba095701ed0d20b6bfecbb1cca68eee4d0433af733af4ce3d6ea898defcda40",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]平衡血压、减轻压力、增进心血管健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a10a263de7729fade0d3",
   "sourceHash": "a10a263de7729fade0d3c7e566d9d6d2a102a7d888b72aed1c40f4686001eef8",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]改善血液循环，支持健康的胆固醇水平，促进放松。",
   "status": "translated",
